[h2]Unofficial community mod[/h2]
Enshrouded Sleep is an unofficial community mod and is not developed by, affiliated with, sponsored by, endorsed by, or otherwise official to The Indie Stone.

Enshrouded Sleep is also not developed by, affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Keen Games. The project name refers only to general multiplayer-sleep design inspiration associated with the game Enshrouded; no Enshrouded code, assets, or game content are included or redistributed.

